      (literal NULLs for a missing window; the job is cancelled on timeout) → the rows read back from the history slice and rows_written /
      data_gaps from the runs row the procedure wrote (an event: its own deal only) → write_watermark after the read-back (window mode;
      releases the lease) → delivery → on failure amend the runs row to OK_DELIVERY_FAILED. On an exception the function amends the
      procedure's OK row to FAILED if it exists, else writes the FAILED row itself; releases the lease; re-raises. Budgets below Cloud
